  "definition_caveat": "The Phase-1 forecasting tunnel begins at the earliest BLOCK DEPTH after which that depth and all subsequent block depths remain within tol of the final-block VALIDATION loss (sustained entry). An isolated early crossing does not open a tunnel. The older first-crossing statistic is retained under the explicitly diagnostic name `first_crossing_<tol>` and is never called the tunnel.",
